  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Complete heavy flightless island bird with deep crested bill, thick neck, short wings, stout legs. Subsequent pool, not frozen72. [\"2016 skeleton Fig15 is composite reconstruction; missing bones shaded and pelvis inferred from Leipoa.\", \"Fig15 does not reconstruct rhamphotheca; use restrained thin keratin contour over fossil bill, not an oversized invented sheath.\", \"2005 Pindai cranial specimens labeled cf.neocaledoniae; genus morphology is useful, but no claim that they belong to same individual as limb means.\", \"Soft body, feathers, skin covering and ornament color are uncertain. Do not copy bright naked skin as fossil fact.\"] {\"unit\": \"meter\", \"model_resting_height_m\": 0.85, \"status\": \"Published reconstruction approximately 0.8–0.85m resting height, not 1.7m upright height or measured individual.\", \"mean_femur_m\": 0.193, \"mean_tibiotarsus_m\": 0.269, \"mean_tarsometatarsus_m\": 0.158, \"NCP242_rostrum_tip_to_hinge_m\": 0.148, \"NCP242_ornament_base_length_m\": 0.052, \"NCP242_ornament_base_width_m\": 0.0412, \"measurement_note\": \"Limb lengths are sample means, skull measurements a separate fossil labeled S.cf.neocaledoniae in2005. They are NOT one articulated individual.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Complete heavy flightless island bird with deep crested bill, thick neck, short wings, stout legs. Subsequent pool, not frozen72. [\"2016 skeleton Fig15 is composite reconstruction; missing bones shaded and pelvis inferred from Leipoa.\", \"Fig15 does not reconstruct rhamphotheca; use restrained thin keratin contour over fossil bill, not an oversized invented sheath.\", \"2005 Pindai cranial specimens labeled cf.neocaledoniae; genus morphology is useful, but no claim that they belong to same individual as limb means.\", \"Soft body, feathers, skin covering and ornament color are uncertain. Do not copy bright naked skin as fossil fact.\"] {\"unit\": \"meter\", \"model_resting_height_m\": 0.85, \"status\": \"Published reconstruction approximately 0.8–0.85m resting height, not 1.7m upright height or measured individual.\", \"mean_femur_m\": 0.193, \"mean_tibiotarsus_m\": 0.269, \"mean_tarsometatarsus_m\": 0.158, \"NCP242_rostrum_tip_to_hinge_m\": 0.148, \"NCP242_ornament_base_length_m\": 0.052, \"NCP242_ornament_base_width_m\": 0.0412, \"measurement_note\": \"Limb lengths are sample means, skull measurements a separate fossil labeled S.cf.neocaledoniae in2005. They are NOT one articulated individual.\"}"
  },
